9	\N	sophia nearing alpha testing stage; improved form handling	[p]I've been working on [link:http://sophia.zoidtechnologies.com/]sophia[/link] for the last few days and it is really coming along. unlike sophia1, posts in sophia2 can be in many sigs at once.[/p]\r\n[p]form handling has been improved, too. there are two new functions in bbsengine3.php for handling forms: processform() and displayform(). expect a more detailed posting as well as a new release later.[/p]	t	f	2015-07-04 18:38:54.190381+00	1	2015-07-28 21:22:58.774801+00	1	f
